    "guide": {
      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "installation": "```sh\ncurl -fsSL --create-dirs --output-dir \"${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/ghostty/themes\" -O \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/living-code-theme/ghostty/main/living-code-{night,frost,paper,signal}\"\n```\n\nThen name one in the Ghostty config, or a light and a dark one:\n\n```conf\ntheme = dark:living-code-night,light:living-code-paper\n```",
      "configuration": "See [Ghostty's documentation](https://ghostty.org) for application settings and reload behavior. The activation instructions above identify each supported flavor; keep your other application configuration.",
      "compatibility": "This port supplies theme files for Ghostty, not the application itself. Install the application separately and follow the installation instructions for its supported configuration format.",
